    "title": "How to Build a Daily Music Listening Routine That Enhances Your Life",
    "excerpt": "Aligning your audio environment with your biological circadian rhythms to boost morning clarity, midday stamina, and evening restoration.",
    "date": "Oct 14, 2026",
    "author": "Pooja Sharma",
